{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object available, approach, grip it, check properties, move, release. Otherwise, scan.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ReleaseObject    /> <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectAvailable    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInGrippingDistance    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = MoveToDestination    />",
